  "description": "This multiplexed immunofluorescence (MxIF) image was generated on a human tonsil section (5 micron, FFPE) using a phenocycler-fusion assay to demonstrate the specificity of the Lung Organ Mapping Antibody Panel-16 (OMAP-16, HBM888.LNHN.284, 34 antibody + DAPI) on non-lung tissue from an unrelated donor. H&E stain on the same slide following MxIF (HBM679.KXJK.793) demonstrates normal structure.",
